OL,3,CCovent Garden stab victims 'knifed in
OL,4,Cback with scissors'
OL,6,FA woman accused of a stabbing spree in
OL,7,FLondon's Covent Garden is accused of
OL,8,Fknifing four men in the back with
OL,9,Fscissors, a court has heard.
OL,11,FStella Gollovena, 47, is accused of
OL,12,Fattacking Patrick De Barr, Thomas
OL,13,FHarding, Adrian Lovett and Mantas
OL,14,FJankus during an incident on Wednesday
OL,15,Flunchtime.
OL,17,FShe has been charged with four counts
OL,18,Fof wounding with intent to cause
OL,19,Fgrievous bodily harm and one count of
OL,20,Fpossession of an offensive weapon, a
OL,21,Fpair of scissors, in a public place.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/5
