FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786202287
OL,3,CCovent Garden stab victims 'knifed in
OL,4,Cback with scissors'
OL,6,FGollovena, of no fixed address, faced
OL,7,Fthe five criminal charges for the
OL,8,Ffirst time in a hearing at Highbury
OL,9,FCorner Magistrates' Court on Thursday
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,12,FThe hearing was told police were
OL,13,F"flagged down" in Endell Street, in a
OL,14,Fbusy tourist area filled with bars,
OL,15,Ftheatres and restaurants, at around
OL,16,F12.25pm by one of the injured victims.
OL,18,FHe and a second man reported being
OL,19,Fstabbed, before the suspect was chased
OL,20,Fand Tasered.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@NO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/5
