OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786202287
OL,3,CCovent Garden stab victims 'knifed in
OL,4,Cback with scissors'
OL,6,FThe court heard police took statements
OL,7,Ffrom four men who were treated in
OL,8,Fhospital for stab wounds to their
OL,9,Fbacks, while a fifth person said at
OL,10,Fthe scene that they had also been
OL,11,Fstabbed but did not want to give a
OL,12,Fstatement to police.
OL,14,FIt is alleged Gollovena had a pair of
OL,15,Fscissors ` also described as a "pair
OL,16,Fof shears" ` on her when she was
OL,17,Farrested.
OL,26,@wD@`OUxD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/5
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
