OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786202287
OL,3,CCovent Garden stab victims 'knifed in
OL,4,Cback with scissors'
OL,6,FDeputy Chief Magistrate Tan Ikram
OL,7,Fremanded Gollovena in custody until
OL,8,Fthe next hearing at Snaresbrook Crown
OL,9,FCourt on September 3.
OL,11,FGollovena spoke to confirm her
OL,12,Fidentity, but did not enter any pleas
OL,13,Fto the charges.
OL,15,FAn air ambulance helicopter landed in
OL,16,Fa packed Trafalgar Square on Wednesday
OL,17,Fafternoon after the stabbings, and
OL,18,FLondon Ambulance Service said it had
OL,19,F"treated four patients at the scene
OL,20,Fand took them all to a major trauma
OL,21,Fcentre as a priority by road".
OL,26,@{D@AOU}D@]O]
