OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786202287
OL,3,CCovent Garden stab victims 'knifed in
OL,4,Cback with scissors'
OL,6,FThe Met said the four men ` aged 34,
OL,7,F39, 42 and 56 ` had stab wounds but
OL,8,Fhave since been discharged from
OL,9,Fhospital as their injuries were not
OL,10,Fdeemed life-threatening or life-
OL,11,Fchanging.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/5
